title: Rudolf Wissell
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, labor
card-image: img/portraits/WissellRudolf.jpg
view-if: wissell_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Rudolf Wissell

Wissell is [? if chancellor = "Wissell": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Wissell": the current President and ?] a labor economist working for the ADGB, the federation of free trade unions, and has been a labor minister on multiple occasions. His priority is to improve conditions for organized workers.

- @labor_affairs_
- @union_unity
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main

@labor_affairs_
title: Labor Rights
subtitle: As Labor Minister, Wissell can help set regulations for working conditions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and spd_in_government and labor_minister_party = "SPD"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if labor_minister_party != "SPD" : The SPD does not control the Labor Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_rights_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: labor_affairs.labor_affairs_menu


@union_unity
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the unions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_dissent -= 5; labor_strength += 5

We have reduced tensions with the Labor faction, and increased its strength in the party.

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Wissell can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Wissell"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Wissell can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Wissell"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ on_the_world_stage_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: on_the_world_stage

